==Notes==
*Some scholars have speculated that a dragon's soul, once severed from its body, may become spread thinly across the world, effectively dissolving over time, or return to its point of origin to join [[Lore:Akatosh|Akatosh]]. As Kaalgrontiid's body was destroyed upon death before any other dragon absorbed his soul, this may help explain his ultimate fate.{{Ref|name=LADragons|{{Cite Book|Loremaster's Archive - Dragons in the Second Era}}}}

